  "description": "Kanject Core realtime over API Gateway WebSockets (proposal 0058 P2): UseApiGatewayWebSockets() posts to each connection through IAmazonApiGatewayManagementApi, bounded and queued for a large audience, with the connections in a registry the host chooses (IRealtimeConnectionRegistry; the DynamoDB one is its own package). The host's Lambda calls its connect, disconnect, message and fan-out entry points with plain values. Every D10 control: listing, ending, server-side subscriptions, renew and the registry sweep.",
